<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <meta name="description" content="ACDV-Teams WiFi Security Tool - Kiểm thử bảo mật không dây chuyên nghiệp. Quét WiFi, tự động kết nối với cơ sở dữ liệu mật khẩu, tấn công WPS, mã hóa file ACDV.">
    <meta name="author" content="Vương Thiên - ACDV-Teams">
    <title>ACDV-Teams | WiFi Security Tool v3.0.1 - Tài liệu kỹ thuật chi tiết</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700;14..32,800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: #0B0E17;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            color: #EFF3FC;
            line-height: 1.5;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
        .bg-aura {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(45, 25, 85, 0.5), rgba(10, 14, 23, 0.96));
            z-index: -2;
        }
        .bg-grid {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(80, 70, 150, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(80, 70, 150, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 32px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        /* Header */
        .navbar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 24px 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(110, 90, 200, 0.25);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            background: rgba(11, 14, 23, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .logo h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C084FC, #F472B6, #38BDF8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        .logo span {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #9CA3AF;
            display: block;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 24px;
            list-style: none;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #E2E8F0;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: 0.2s;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: #C084FC; }
        /* Hero tool */
        .hero {
            padding: 60px 0 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #F0F9FF, #C084FC);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        .hero p {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            color: #B9C7D9;
        }
        .badge-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .tech-badge {
            background: #262B44;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
        /* Section headers */
        .section-header {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 50px 0 30px;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
        }
        .section-header i {
            color: #C084FC;
            margin-right: 12px;
        }
        /* Feature cards */
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 32px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(18, 22, 35, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 28px 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            border-color: #A78BFA;
            transform: translateY(-6px);
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #C084FC;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .feature-card h4 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin: 15px 0 8px;
            color: #F472B6;
        }
        .feature-card p, .feature-card li {
            color: #C9D1E6;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-left: 18px;
        }
        .feature-card code {
            background: #1E1B3A;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #5eead4;
        }
        /* Class detail */
        .class-detail {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #C084FC;
        }
        .class-name {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #F472B6;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .method-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .method-item {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
        .method-name {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            color: #5eead4;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        /* Terminal simulation */
        .terminal-preview {
            background: #0A0C14;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            border: 1px solid #2D2A5A;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }
        .terminal-line {
            color: #5eead4;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
        /* Database showcase */
        .db-show {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .db-entry {
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 6px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #4b3b7a;
        }
        /* Flowchart */
        .flowchart {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
        .flow-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin: 15px 0;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .flow-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E1B3A, #2D2A5A);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            min-width: 150px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .flow-arrow {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #C084FC;
        }
        /* API Table */
        .api-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .api-table th, .api-table td {
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
        }
        .api-table th {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
            color: #C084FC;
        }
        .api-table code {
            background: #1E1B3A;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }
        /* Disclaimer */
        .disclaimer {
            background: #1E1B3A80;
            border-left: 4px solid #F97316;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }
        .admin-card {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            background: rgba(25, 30, 45, 0.6);
            border-radius: 48px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .admin-card img {
            width: 80px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid #F472B6;
        }
        .contact-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .fb-link, .telegram-link {
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .fb-link {
            background: #1877F2;
        }
        .telegram-link {
            background: #26A5E4;
        }
        .fb-link:hover, .telegram-link:hover {
            filter: brightness(1.1);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .open-source-note {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 196, 0.08);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.3);
        }
        .open-source-note i {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #2DD4BF;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .toc {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .toc ul {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            list-style: none;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .toc a {
            color: #C084FC;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(110, 90, 200, 0.3);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #7A7F9E;
        }
        @media (max-width: 800px) {
            .container { padding: 0 20px; }
            .hero h2 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .section-header { font-size: 1.5rem; }
        }
        button {
            background: linear-gradient(95deg, #8B5CF6, #D946EF);
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        hr {
            border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .stats-grid {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .stat-card {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            min-width: 150px;
        }
        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #C084FC;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg-aura"></div>
<div class="bg-grid"></div>

<div class="container">
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="logo">
            <h1>⚡ ACDV-Teams WiFi Tool</h1>
            <span>GHOST PROTOCOL • ZERO TRUST • PENTEST v3.0</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#tong-quan">Tổng quan</a></li>
            <li><a href="#classes">Classes</a></li>
            <li><a href="#flowchart">Luồng hoạt động</a></li>
